@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

title Deployment View - Docker Compose (Lab 5 - Security, Jun 2026)

node "Developer Machine" {
  node "Docker Engine" {

    rectangle "subnet_a\n(Public Zone)" #LightBlue {
      node "frontend container\nNext.js :3000" as Frontend
      node "api-gateway container\nNginx :8000 (HTTP→301)\n     :8443 (HTTPS/TLS)" as Gateway
    }

    rectangle "subnet_b\n(Private Zone)" #LightYellow {
      node "auth-service container\n:8001" as Auth
      node "user-service container\n:8002->8000" as UserService
      node "product-service container\n:8003" as Product
      node "order-service container\n:8004" as Order
      node "ai-service container\n:8005\n[Rate Limit: 10r/60s Redis]" as AI

      database "auth-postgres\n:5432" as AuthDB
      database "user-postgres\n:5432" as UserDB
      database "order-postgres\n:5432" as OrderDB
      database "product-postgres\n:5432" as ProductDB
      database "redis\n:6379\n(sessions + rate limit)" as Redis
      queue "rabbitmq\n:5672 / :15672" as MQ
    }

    artifact "TLS Certificate\nnginx.crt / nginx.key\n(self-signed, RSA 2048)" as Cert
  }
}

Frontend --> Gateway : HTTPS :8443\n(NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL)
Gateway --> Auth     : HTTP /auth/\n[Rate: 10r/s burst 20]
Gateway --> UserService : HTTP /users/, /internal/\n[Rate: 10r/s burst 20]
Gateway --> Product  : HTTP /products/\n[Rate: 10r/s burst 20]
Gateway --> Order    : HTTP /orders/\n[Rate: 10r/s burst 10]
Gateway --> AI       : HTTP /ai/\n[Rate: 2r/s burst 5]
Gateway ..> Cert     : loads

Auth --> AuthDB
Auth --> Redis
Auth --> MQ

UserService --> UserDB
UserService --> MQ

Product --> ProductDB
Product --> Redis
Product --> UserService

Order --> OrderDB
Order --> Product
Order --> MQ

AI --> Redis : sliding window\nrate limit keys
AI --> Product
AI --> UserService
AI --> Order

note bottom of Gateway
  **Reverse Proxy Pattern**
  Single public entry point.
  Hides internal topology.
  SSL termination here.
end note

note bottom of Redis
  **Rate Limiting**
  key: rate_limit:ai:<user|ip>
  Sliding window counter
end note

@enduml
